Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["TverskyLossLayer", "ObjectName",
 CellID->74152269,ExpressionUUID->"7b29f500-6931-9a47-96e0-0f97375ec393"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"94f24532-282f-cd4d-80ef-e00d7b2ac387"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["TverskyLossLayer",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsNeuralNetworkTools/ref/TverskyLossLayer"], "[",
    "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "7c4fdd0c-187e-204e-a548-ac06bb822875"],
 "\[LineSeparator]represents a net layer that computes the Tversky loss by \
comparing input class probability vectors with the target class vector. \n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"5ef3fbde-936a-a24e-845a-edf0aa4c5587"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["TverskyLossLayer",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsNeuralNetworkTools/ref/TverskyLossLayer"], "[", 
   StyleBox["b", "TI"], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "11521c22-d9b5-2c4b-90eb-2dfe9e978a16"],
 "\[LineSeparator]does the same but b defines the Tversky beta factor. With \
beta = 0.5 its is the Dice coefficient. Here alpha + beta = 1."
}], "Usage",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996655710452715*^9, 3.9966557105298347`*^9}},
 CellID->124932172,ExpressionUUID->"edd0c728-fdde-e040-8bbf-339768fef061"],

Cell["XXXX", "Notes",
 CellID->258432762,ExpressionUUID->"2a416d5f-8363-3d40-9aec-822a4f2cd582"]
